/**
 * @defgroup FtpcGeo FtpcGeo — STAR Forward TPC and Supports Geometry
 * @ingroup StarVMCGeometry
 * @brief AGML geometry definition for the STAR Forward Time Projection Chamber.
 * @details
 * The STAR Forward TPC (FTPC) provides charged-particle tracking in the
 * pseudorapidity range 2.5 < |η| < 4.0.  Two identical cylindrical radial-drift
 * chambers are placed symmetrically at z = ±150 cm from the interaction point,
 * each extending 119 cm along the beam axis.  Ionisation electrons in the
 * Ne/CO₂ drift gas drift radially inward toward 10 concentric padrow layers
 * (LayLen = 2 cm each) arranged in 6 azimuthal sectors of 6 readout modules.
 *
 * Key global parameters (structure @c FTPG):
 *   - RinnerMs = 7.55 cm (original) / 7.40 cm (Geo1) — inner envelope radius
 *   - RouterMs = 36.4 cm — outer envelope radius
 *   - RGasOut  = 30.6 cm — outer radius of the active gas volume
 *   - Zstart   = 150.0 cm — face position from IP
 *   - totLen   = 119.0 cm — overall detector length
 *   - GasVolDz = 59.5 cm  — half-length of active gas volume
 *   - Hitlay   = 10       — number of padrows per disk
 *
 * Reference: NIM A522 (2004) 252–273.
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @defgroup FtpcGeo_v0 FtpcGeo — Original Forward TPC geometry
 * @ingroup FtpcGeo
 * @brief Module @c FTPCGEO: original FTPC geometry definition.
 * @details
 * Uses four structures: @c FTPG (basic FTPC dimensions), @c FFCC (field-cage
 * end-cap ceramic holders and stabiliser bars), @c FRBD (readout barrel module
 * positions and box dimensions), and @c FSSD (end-ring and support polygon
 * geometry).
 *
 * Inner tube material: DrInAlL1 = DrInAlL2 = 0.05 cm (Al layers),
 * DrInIsoL = 0.40 cm (insulating plastic).
 *
 * Volume tree top-level: @c FTPC (mother) → @c FGAS (gas volume) →
 * @c FSEN / @c FSEC (sensitive volume / sector divisions), @c FROS (readout
 * module ring, ×10 padrows) → @c FROM (readout module), @c FSER (support end
 * rings), @c FSSM (main support module).
 * Activated by setups @c FTPCon and @c FTPC00.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup FtpcGeo_v1 FtpcGeo1 — Forward TPC with corrected gas material budget
 * @ingroup FtpcGeo
 * @brief Module @c FTPCGEO1: FTPC geometry with reduced inner-tube material budget.
 * @details
 * Functionally identical to @c FTPCGEO except for thinned inner-tube layers:
 *   - RinnerMs reduced from 7.55 cm to 7.40 cm (slightly smaller inner bore).
 *   - DrInAlL1 = DrInAlL2 = 0.01 cm (was 0.05 cm): thinner Al layers.
 *   - DrInIsoL = 0.30 cm (was 0.40 cm): thinner insulating plastic.
 *
 * These changes reduce the material budget seen by forward tracks, improving
 * simulation accuracy.  All 31 other volumes (@c FGAS, @c FSEN, @c FSEC,
 * @c FIFR, @c FKWI, @c FFSL, @c FFCE, @c FROS, @c FROM, hole volumes,
 * @c FREL, @c FRCC, @c FRCE, support rings, pad plane, outermost FC ring)
 * are unchanged.
 * Activated by setup @c FTPC01.
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
